msgstr "Newid maint yr isdeitlau lle bo modd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:830
msgid "Enable sub-pictures"
msgstr "Galluogi is-luniau"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:832
msgid "You can completely disable the sub-picture processing."
msgstr "Gallwch analluogi prosesu is-luniau yn llwyr."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:834
msgid "Display sub-pictures on full window"
msgstr "Dangos is-luniau ar y ffenestr gyfan"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:836
msgid "It allows showing subtitles in black bars."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu dangos isdeitlau yn y barrau du."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:838
msgid "Position of secondary subtitles"
msgstr "Safle'r ail isdeitlau"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:840
msgid ""
"Place on video where to display secondary subtitles (default bottom center)."
msgstr ""
"Y man ar y fideo lle bydd yr ail isdeitlau'n cael eu dangos (yn ddiofyn, "
"gwaelod canol)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:842
msgid "Force secondary subtitle position"
msgstr "Gorfodi lleoliad yr ail isdeitlau"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:844
msgid ""
"You can use this option to vertically adjust the position secondary "
"subtitles are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Gallwch ddefnyddio'r dewis hwn i addasu'n fertigol y safle lle mae'r ail "
"isdeitlau'n cael eu dangos."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:847
msgid "On Screen Display duration"
msgstr "Hyd y Dangosiad ar y Sgrin"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:849
msgid "How long the messages of the On Screen Display stay, in milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Am ba hyd mae negeseuon y Dangosiad ar y Sgrin yn aros, mewn milieiliadau."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:850 src/libvlc-module.c:1827 src/text/iso-639_def.h:573
#: modules/gui/macosx/preferences/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:441
msgid "On Screen Display"
msgstr "Arddangosiad ar y Sgrin (OSD)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:852
msgid ""
"VLC can display messages on the video. This is called OSD (On Screen "
"Display)."
msgstr ""
"Gall VLC dangos negeseuon ar y fideo. Dyma yw 'arddangosiad ar y sgrin', neu "
"OSD - 'On Screen Display'."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:855
msgid "Text rendering module"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:857
msgid ""
"VLC normally uses Freetype for rendering, but this allows you to use svg for "
"instance."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:859
msgid "Subpictures source module"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:861
msgid ""
"This adds so-called \"subpicture sources\". These filters overlay some "
"images or text over the video (like a logo, arbitrary text, ...)."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:864
msgid "Subpictures filter module"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:866
msgid ""
"This adds so-called \"subpicture filters\". These filter subpictures created "
"by subtitle decoders or other subpictures sources."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:869
msgid "Autodetect subtitle files"
msgstr "Canfod ffeiliau isdeitlau yn awtomatig"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:871
msgid ""
"Automatically detect a subtitle file, if no subtitle filename is specified "
"(based on the filename of the movie)."
msgstr ""
"Canfod ffeil isdeitlau yn awtomatig, os na nodir enw ffeil isdeitlau (yn "
"seiliedig ar enw ffeil y ffilm)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:874
msgid "Subtitle autodetection fuzziness"
msgstr "Manylder canfyddiad isdeitlau awtomatig"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:876
msgid ""
"This determines how fuzzy subtitle and movie filename matching will be. "
"Options are:\n"
"0 = no subtitles autodetected\n"
"1 = any subtitle file\n"
"2 = any subtitle file containing the movie name\n"
"3 = subtitle file matching the movie name with additional chars\n"
"4 = subtitle file matching the movie name exactly"
msgstr ""
"Mae hwn yn rheoli pa mor fanwl mae'n rhaid enwau ffeiliau fideo ac isdeitlau "
"cydweddu a'i gilydd. Yr opsiynau yw:\n"
"0 = peidio canfod isdeitlau\n"
"1 = unrhyw ffeil isdeitlau\n"
"2 = unrhyw ffeil isdeitlau sy'n cynnwys enw'r fideo\n"
"3 = ffeil isdeitlau gydag enw'r fideo yn ei enw a rhai nodau ychwanegol\n"
"4 = ffeil isdeitlau gyda'r union un enw a'r ffeil fideo"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:884
msgid "Subtitle autodetection paths"
msgstr "Llwybrau canfod isdeitlau'n awtomatig"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:886
msgid ""
"Look for a subtitle file in those paths too, if your subtitle file was not "
"found in the current directory."
msgstr ""
"Edrych am ffeil isdeitlau yn y lleoliadau hyn hefyd os nad yw ffeil "
"isdeitlau yn cael ei ganfod yn y cyfeiriadur presennol."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:889
msgid "Subtitle Frames per Second"
msgstr "Fframiau yr Eiliad yr Isdeitlau"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:891
msgid "Override the normal frames per second settings. "
msgstr "Diystyru'r gosodiadau fframiau yr eiliad arferol. "

#: src/libvlc-module.c:893
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:271
#: modules/spu/subsdelay.c:267
msgid "Subtitle delay"
msgstr "Oediad yr isdeitlau"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:895
msgid "Apply a delay to all subtitles (in 1/10s, eg 100 means 10s)."
msgstr ""
"Rhoi oediad ar bob isdeitl (mewn 1/10 eiliad, e.e. mae 100 yn golygu 10 "
"eiliad)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:897
msgid "Use subtitle file"
msgstr "Defnyddio ffeil isdeitlau"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:899
msgid ""
"Load this subtitle file. To be used when autodetect cannot detect your "
"subtitle file."
msgstr ""
"Llwytho'r ffeil isdeitlau hwn. (I'w ddefnyddio pan na all canfyddiad "
"awtomatig canfod y ffeil.)"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:903
msgid "DVD device"
msgstr "Dyfais DVD"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:904
msgid "VCD device"
msgstr "Dyfais VCD"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:905 modules/access/cdda.c:822
msgid "Audio CD device"
msgstr "Dyfais CD sain"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:909
msgid ""
"This is the default DVD drive (or file) to use. Don't forget the colon after "
"the drive letter (e.g. D:)"
msgstr ""
"Hwn yw'r ddyfais gyriant DVD rhagosodedig i'w ddefnyddio. Rhaid cofio'r "
"colon ar ôl llythyren y gyriant (e.e. D:)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:912
msgid ""
"This is the default VCD drive (or file) to use. Don't forget the colon after "
"the drive letter (e.g. D:)"
msgstr ""
"Hwn yw'r ddyfais gyriant VCD rhagosodedig i'w ddefnyddio. Rhaid cofio'r "
"colon ar ôl llythyren y gyriant (e.e. D:)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:919
msgid "This is the default DVD device to use."
msgstr "Hwn yw'r ddyfais DVD rhagosodedig i'w ddefnyddio."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:921
msgid "This is the default VCD device to use."
msgstr "Hwn yw'r ddyfais VCD rhagosodedig i'w ddefnyddio."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:935
msgid "TCP connection timeout"
msgstr "Terfyn amser cysylltiad TCP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:937
msgid "Default TCP connection timeout (in milliseconds)."
msgstr "Terfyn amser rhagosodedig cysylltiad TCP (mewn milieiliadau)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:939
msgid "HTTP server address"
msgstr "Cyfeiriad HTTP y gweinydd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:941
msgid ""
"By default, the server will listen on any local IP address. Specify an IP "
"address (e.g. ::1 or 127.0.0.1) or a host name (e.g. localhost) to restrict "
"them to a specific network interface."
msgstr ""
"Yn rhagosodedig, mae'r gweinydd yn gwrando ar unrhyw gyfeiriad IP lleol. "
"Nodwch gyfeiriad IP (e.e. ::1 neu 127.0.0.1) neu enw gwesteiwr (e.e. "
"localhost) i'w cyfyngu at ryngwyneb rhwydwaith penodol."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:945
msgid "RTSP server address"
msgstr "Cyfeiriad RTSP y gweinydd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:947
msgid ""
"This defines the address the RTSP server will listen on, along with the base "
"path of the RTSP VOD media. Syntax is address/path. By default, the server "
"will listen on any local IP address. Specify an IP address (e.g. ::1 or "
"127.0.0.1) or a host name (e.g. localhost) to restrict them to a specific "
"network interface."
msgstr ""
"Mae hwn yn diffinio'r cyfeiriad mae'r gweinydd RTSP yn gwrando arno, ynghyd "
"a llwybr craidd yr eitem cyfryngol RTSP VOD. Y gystrawen yw cyfeiriad/"
"llwybr. Yn rhagosodedig, mae'r gweinydd yn gwrando ar unrhyw gyfeiriad IP "
"lleol. Nodwch gyfeiriad IP (e.e. ::1 neu 127.0.0.1) neu enw gwesteiwr (e.e. "
"localhost) i'w cyfyngu at ryngwyneb rhwydwaith penodol."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:953
msgid "HTTP server port"
msgstr "Porth HTTP y gweinydd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:955
msgid ""
"The HTTP server will listen on this TCP port. The standard HTTP port number "
"is 80. However allocation of port numbers below 1025 is usually restricted "
"by the operating system."
msgstr ""
"Bydd y gweinydd HTTP yn gwrando ar y porth TCP hwn. Rhif porth safonol HTTP "
"yw 80. Mae'r system weithredu fel arfer yn cyfyngu rhifau porth o dan 1025."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:960
msgid "HTTPS server port"
msgstr "Porth HTTPS y gweinydd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:962
msgid ""
"The HTTPS server will listen on this TCP port. The standard HTTPS port "
"number is 443. However allocation of port numbers below 1025 is usually "
"restricted by the operating system."
msgstr ""
"Bydd y gweinydd HTTPS yn gwrando ar y porth TCP hwn. Rhif porth safonol "
"HTTPS yw 443. Mae'r system weithredu fel arfer yn cyfyngu rhifau porth o dan "
"1025."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:967
msgid "RTSP server port"
msgstr "Porth RTSP y gweinydd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:969
msgid ""
"The RTSP server will listen on this TCP port. The standard RTSP port number "
"is 554. However allocation of port numbers below 1025 is usually restricted "
"by the operating system."
msgstr ""
"Bydd y gweinydd RTSP yn gwrando ar y porth TCP hwn. Rhif porth safonol RTSP "
"yw 554. Mae'r system weithredu fel arfer yn cyfyngu rhifau porth o dan 1025."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:974
msgid "HTTP/TLS server certificate"
msgstr "Tystysgrif HTTP/TLS y gweinydd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:976
msgid ""
"This X.509 certificate file (PEM format) is used for server-side TLS. On OS "
"X, the string is used as a label to search the certificate in the keychain."
msgstr ""
"Defnyddir y ffeil tystysgrif X.509 hon (fformat PEM) ar gyfer TLS ochr y "
"gweinydd. Ar OS X, defnyddir y llinyn fel label i chwilio am y dystysgrif yn "
"y gadwyn allweddi."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:979
msgid "HTTP/TLS server private key"
msgstr "Allwedd preifat HTTP/TLS y gweinydd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:981
msgid "This private key file (PEM format) is used for server-side TLS."
msgstr ""
"Defnyddir y ffeil allwedd preifat hwn (fformat PEM) ar gyfer TLS ochr y "
"gweinydd."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:983
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:330
msgid "HTTP proxy"
msgstr "Procsi HTTP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:985
msgid ""
"HTTP proxy to be used It must be of the form http://"
"[user@]myproxy.mydomain:myport/ ; if empty, the http_proxy environment "
"variable will be tried."
msgstr ""
"Y procsi HTTP i'w ddefnyddio. Rhaid iddo fod ar y ffurf http://"
"[user@]myproxy.mydomain:myport/ ; os yw'n wag, rhoddir cynnig ar y newidyn "
"amgylchedd http_proxy."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:989
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/preferences/qml/SettingsPresentation.qml:331
msgid "HTTP proxy password"
msgstr "Cyfrinair procsi HTTP"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:991
msgid "If your HTTP proxy requires a password, set it here."
msgstr "Os oes angen cyfrinair ar eich procsi HTTP, gosodwch ef yma."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:993
msgid "Title metadata"
msgstr "Metaddata'r teitl"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:995
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"title\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu gosod metaddata \"teitl\" ar gyfer allbwn."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:997
msgid "Author metadata"
msgstr "Metaddata'r awdur"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:999
msgid "Allows you to specify an \"author\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu gosod metaddata \"awdur\" ar gyfer allbwn."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1001
msgid "Artist metadata"
msgstr "Metaddata'r artist"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1003
msgid "Allows you to specify an \"artist\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu gosod metaddata \"artist\" ar gyfer allbwn."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1005
msgid "Genre metadata"
msgstr "Metaddata'r genre"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1007
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"genre\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu gosod metaddata \"genre\" ar gyfer allbwn."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1009
msgid "Copyright metadata"
msgstr "Hawlfraint metaddata"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1011
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"copyright\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu gosod metaddata \"hawlfraint\" ar gyfer allbwn."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1013
msgid "Description metadata"
msgstr "Metaddata'r disgrifiad"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1015
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"description\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu gosod metaddata \"disgrifiad\" ar gyfer allbwn."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1017
msgid "Date metadata"
msgstr "Metadata'r dyddiad"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1019
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"date\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu gosod metaddata \"dyddiad\" ar gyfer allbwn."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1021
msgid "URL metadata"
msgstr "URL metadata"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1023
msgid "Allows you to specify a \"url\" metadata for an input."
msgstr "Mae'n caniatáu gosod metaddata \"url\" ar gyfer allbwn."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1027
msgid ""
"These options allow you to control the preferred modules used for accessing, "
"demuxing and decoding (or encoding) inputs."
msgstr ""
"Mae'r dewisiadau hyn yn caniatáu i chi reoli'r modiwlau a ffefrir ar gyfer "
"cyrchu, datblecsio a datgodio (neu amgodio) mewnbynnau."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1030
msgid "Preferred decoders list"
msgstr "Rhestr datgodwyr a hoffwyd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1032
msgid ""
"List of codecs that VLC will use in priority. For instance, 'dummy,a52' will "
"try the dummy and a52 codecs before trying the other ones. Only advanced "
"users should alter this option as it can break playback of all your streams."
msgstr ""
"Rhestr o godecs y bydd VLC yn eu defnyddio gyntaf. Er enghraifft, bydd "
"'dummy,a52' yn rhoi cynnig ar y codecs dummy ac a52 cyn rhoi cynnig ar y "
"lleill. Dim ond defnyddwyr profiadol ddylai newid yr opsiwn hwn gan y gall "
"dorri chwarae eich holl ffrydiau."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1037
msgid "Enable hardware decoders"
msgstr "Galluogi datgodwyr caledwedd"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1039
msgid ""
"VLC will fallback automatically to software decoders in case of hardware "
"decoder failure."
msgstr ""
"Bydd VLC yn troi'n awtomatig at ddatgodwyr meddalwedd os bydd y datgodiwr "
"caledwedd yn methu."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1042
msgid "Preferred decoder hardware device"
msgstr "Dyfais caledwedd datgodio a ffefrir"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1043
msgid "This allows hardware decoding when available."
msgstr "Mae hyn yn caniatáu datgodio gan y caledwedd pan ar gael."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1051
msgid ""
"These options allow you to set default global options for the stream output "
"subsystem."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1054
msgid "Default stream output chain"
msgstr "Cadwyn allbwn ffrwd rhagosodedig"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1056
msgid ""
"You can enter here a default stream output chain. Refer to the documentation "
"to learn how to build such chains. Warning: this chain will be enabled for "
"all streams."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1060
msgid "Enable streaming of all ES"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1062
msgid "Stream all elementary streams (video, audio and subtitles)"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1064
msgid "Display while streaming"
msgstr "Dangos wrth ei ffrydio"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1066
msgid "Play locally the stream while streaming it."
msgstr "Chwarae'r ffrwd yma wrth ei ffrydio"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1068
msgid "Enable video stream output"
msgstr "Galluogi allbwn ffrwd fideo"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1070
msgid ""
"Choose whether the video stream should be redirected to the stream output "
"facility when this last one is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Dewis a ddylai'r ffrwd fideo gael ei hailgyfeirio i'r cyfleuster allbwn "
"ffrwd pan fo hwnnw wedi'i alluogi."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1073
msgid "Enable audio stream output"
msgstr "Galluogi allbwn ffrwd sain"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1075
msgid ""
"Choose whether the audio stream should be redirected to the stream output "
"facility when this last one is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Dewis a ddylai'r ffrwd sain gael ei hailgyfeirio i'r cyfleuster allbwn ffrwd "
"pan fo hwnnw wedi'i alluogi."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1078
msgid "Enable SPU stream output"
msgstr "Galluogi allbwn ffrwd SPU"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1080
msgid ""
"Choose whether the SPU streams should be redirected to the stream output "
"facility when this last one is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Dewis a ddylai'r ffrydiau SPU gael eu hailgyfeirio i'r cyfleuster allbwn "
"ffrwd pan fo hwnnw wedi'i alluogi."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1083
msgid "Keep stream output open"
msgstr "Cadw'r allbwn ffrwd ar agor"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1085
msgid ""
"This allows you to keep an unique stream output instance across multiple "
"play queue items."
msgstr ""
"Mae hwn yn gadael i chi gadw un enghraifft allbwn ffrwd ar draws sawl eitem "
"yn y ciw chwarae."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1088
msgid "Stream output muxer caching (ms)"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1090
msgid ""
"This allow you to configure the initial caching amount for stream output "
"muxer. This value should be set in milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1093
msgid "Preferred packetizer list"
msgstr "Rhestr pecynyddion dewisol"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1095
msgid ""
"This allows you to select the order in which VLC will choose its packetizers."
msgstr "Mae hyn yn caniatau dewis y drefn mae VLC yn dewis y pecynyddion"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1098
msgid "SAP announcement interval"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1100
msgid ""
"When the SAP flow control is disabled, this lets you set the fixed interval "
"between SAP announcements."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1107
msgid "Access module"
msgstr "Modiwl cyrchu"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1109
msgid ""
"This allows you to force an access module. You can use it if the correct "
"access is not automatically detected. You should not set this as a global "
"option unless you really know what you are doing."
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1113
msgid "Stream filter module"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1115
#, fuzzy
msgid "Stream filters are used to modify the stream that is being read."
msgstr "Defnyddir hidlyddion fideo i brosesu'r ffrwd fideo."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1117
#, fuzzy
